MAIN KYA BATOU KE KYA KYA GUZAR GAYI AMMA<br>
MAIN SUCHTI HUN KE MAIN KYUN NA MARGAYI AMMA<br>
<br>
1.Sunane Ranj O Alam Karbala Se Aayi Hu<br>
Rasool e Pakh Ki Umaat Ki Main Satayi Hu<br>
Nashan e Dagh e Rasan Bazuou Pe Laayi Hu<br>
<br>
2.Bhara Howa Tha Tera Ghar Jo Subhe Aashora<br>
Ke Ek Din Me Howa Qatl Ghar ka Ghar Saara<br>
Hussain Bhai Ka Be Sar Padha Raha Laasha<br>
<br>
3.Wo Sham Sham e Ghareeba Daare Howe Bache<br>
Baadhe Jo Julm Ke Saaye Toh Khouf Se Bache<br>
Na Maange Aabo Giza Aur Sogaye Bache<br>
<br>
4.Main Kya Batou Sakina Pe Kya Sitam Guzre<br>
Tamache Marke Rukhsar Kardiye Neele<br>
Na Rone Paayi Na So Paayi Shimr Ke Dar Se<br>
<br>
5.Bhula Na Payengi Manzar Wo Zainab e Muztar<br>
Ke Ek Nigha Thi Qaime Pe Ek Khanjar Par<br>
Barhena Sar Chali Aaye Na Soch Kar Khahar<br>
<br>
6.Barhena Sar Sar e Bazar Thi Teri Dukhtar<br>
Nigha e Gair Ke Chubte They Qalb Me Khanjar<br>
Wo Zakhm Aj Bhi Taaza Hai Qalbe Zainab Par<br>
<br>
7.Wo Asr e Tang Ka Hanggam Gurbat e Sarwar<br>
Raage Gale Ki Na Katti Thi Kund Tha Khanjar<br>
Hussain Paon Raghde The Khakh e Maqtal Par<br>
<br>
8.Likha Hai Tune Jo Nouha Najaf Ali Shoukat<br>
Mili Hai Mehdi Ko Zikre Hussain Se Izzat<br>
Bayan Kardi Jo Baad e Hussain Thi Gurbat
